<title>UK: JP Morgan leads $693.75 mln asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan leads $693.75 mln asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MBNA MCCT 2 SERIES 1997-E</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $537.5	  BASE	 LIBOR     MATURITY   *  .SEP.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+8 BP     PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   27.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. *EXPECTED MATURITY 15.APR.02</p>
<p>		AVG LIFE 4.94 YEARS</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS UK</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B NOTES OF $56.25 MLN, TO BE</p>
<p>		PRICED AROUND LIBOR +28 BP.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
